# <%= it.name %>

<% if (it.description) { %><%= it.description %><% } else { %>A game built with the DownDraft Engine.<% } %>

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
bun install

# Start dev server
bun run dev

# Build for production
bun run build

# Export for distribution
bun run export
```

## Project Structure

```
src/          Game source code
  main.ts     Entry point (init, tick, dispose)
assets/       Game assets (models, textures, shaders)
downdraft.config.json   Engine configuration
```

## Engine

Built with [DownDraft Engine](https://github.com/downdraft-engine) — a TypeScript-first game engine on Electron + WebGPU.
